<title>MEXICO: Mexico's Jose Maria Fernandez Unsain dead at 72.</title>
<headline>Mexico's Jose Maria Fernandez Unsain dead at 72.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jose Maria Fernandez Unsain, leader of the General Association of Writers of Mexico, died on Wednesday at age 72, a television report said.</p>
<p>Fernandez Unsain, born in Argentina, came to Mexico in 1958 and received Mexican citizenship 10 years later.</p>
<p>He will be honoured Thursday during a ceremony of the writers association, according to the report on Televisa's 24 Horus news programme.</p>
